    "plain": "A supply chain duty of care could level the playing field for responsible businesses and reduce the economic drag of forced labour, but compliance costs \u2014 especially for smaller firms \u2014 are a real near-term concern, and the long-term gains are genuinely contested. The net effect on prosperity is uncertain but likely modest either way.",
